      "note": "TASCAM SS-CDR250N spec sheet (research read): analog in XLR-3-31 balanced (line or mic, phantom) and RCA pair, analog out XLR-3-32 and RCA pair, AES/EBU XLR in and out, S/PDIF RCA in and out, 6.3 mm phones, remote 2.5 mm TRS, USB-A, RS-232C DB9, parallel DB25, RJ45; the sheet is ambiguous on whether the XLR input is one jack or an L/R pair, so beta-modelled with the 14 Beta proposal ports (L/R XLR pairs), positions guesses (phones on the front). Size 482.6 x 300.5 x 45 mm (W x H x D, labelled). Not modelled: media (two SD slots, CD drive: a picture only), DB9, 2.5 mm remote, USB-A, Ethernet, mains inlet (not stated)."
